      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "In yellow yarn, start with a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "magic-ring-a180"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "magic ring"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Round 1: 6 dc. Round 2: 2 dc in each (12 sts). Round 3: (dc, 2 dc in next) x 6 (18 sts). Round 4: (2 dc, 2 dc in next) x 6 (24 sts). Apply "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "colour-change-a180"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "colour change"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " to black at the end of round 4. Rounds 5-6: dc in black. Colour change to yellow. Rounds 7-8: dc in yellow. Colour change to black. Rounds 9-10: dc in black. Colour change to yellow. Round 11: (2 dc, "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "dc2tog-a180"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "dc2tog"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ") x 6 (18 sts). Round 12: (dc, dc2tog) x 6 (12 sts). Stuff. Apply "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "invisible-finish-a180"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "invisible finish"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and close."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Wings (make 2)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "In white yarn, magic ring 6 dc. Round 2: 2 dc in each (12 sts). Round 3: (dc, 2 dc in next) x 6 (18 sts). Round 4: dc around. Slip stitch to close."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Assembly"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Sew wings side by side on the top of the body. Embroider two small black dot eyes near the yellow nose end. Add two short black antenna lines using your tapestry needle. Attach a keychain clip through the magic ring at the nose end."
          }
        ]
      }
